# Cerebral Confiscation, first mode: "Target opponent discards two cards." (CR 700.2, 701.9a, 701.9b) The discarding player chooses which cards: Bot2 holds a Lightning Bolt, a Memnite and Mountains, and
# keeps whichever two they do not choose to discard (Bot2 chooses a Mountain and the Bolt, keeping the Memnite). Bot1 is not asked to choose or look at the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cerebral Confiscation
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Cerebral Confiscation.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Target opponent discards two cards)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Mountain; Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand = Memnite; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Mountain
